{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Mauri Mursu's Odyssey",
    "steam_appid": 3207480,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/33dd209700ec768f130b00964ec4f170.avif?t=1740594791\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/ceda63d3595d6815b3bcada604b1deb3.avif?t=1740594791\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the legendary girth of Mauri the Walrus take you on an adventure unlike any other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a colourful cast of silly critters, visit memorable locations and flatten your enemies with true-and-tested Mauri-style! Ready your flippers and sharpen your tusks and be the walrus Helen of Troy dreams of at night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/6ef4aa16b8015ee24dd94d6e84d05688.avif?t=1740594791\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/73978067f44f72da99c35943eba53e39.poster.avif?t=1740594791\" width=760 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/73978067f44f72da99c35943eba53e39.webm?t=1740594791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/73978067f44f72da99c35943eba53e39.mp4?t=1740594791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the true Iliad! Embark on a journey of epic proportions! Test your mettle and fulfil your destiny as Mauri the Walrus faces a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the wind in your blubber as you travel from island to island and spit Death in the eye socket for even looking at you funny. Do you possess the cardinal virtues of a hero and the strength of mind to rekindle the fires to light the path for the future?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/8e8dfc467d0b0c5d852f8fea09f52950.avif?t=1740594791\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/cfcc5237c353de2d6f3faf07d2ba735f.poster.avif?t=1740594791\" width=760 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/cfcc5237c353de2d6f3faf07d2ba735f.webm?t=1740594791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/cfcc5237c353de2d6f3faf07d2ba735f.mp4?t=1740594791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Platonic Forms might need some readjusting, because Mauri is the only walrus you need in your head.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/33dd209700ec768f130b00964ec4f170.avif?t=1740594791\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/ceda63d3595d6815b3bcada604b1deb3.avif?t=1740594791\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the legendary girth of Mauri the Walrus take you on an adventure unlike any other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a colourful cast of silly critters, visit memorable locations and flatten your enemies with true-and-tested Mauri-style! Ready your flippers and sharpen your tusks and be the walrus Helen of Troy dreams of at night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/6ef4aa16b8015ee24dd94d6e84d05688.avif?t=1740594791\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/73978067f44f72da99c35943eba53e39.poster.avif?t=1740594791\" width=760 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/73978067f44f72da99c35943eba53e39.webm?t=1740594791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/73978067f44f72da99c35943eba53e39.mp4?t=1740594791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the true Iliad! Embark on a journey of epic proportions! Test your mettle and fulfil your destiny as Mauri the Walrus faces a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the wind in your blubber as you travel from island to island and spit Death in the eye socket for even looking at you funny. Do you possess the cardinal virtues of a hero and the strength of mind to rekindle the fires to light the path for the future?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/8e8dfc467d0b0c5d852f8fea09f52950.avif?t=1740594791\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/cfcc5237c353de2d6f3faf07d2ba735f.poster.avif?t=1740594791\" width=760 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/cfcc5237c353de2d6f3faf07d2ba735f.webm?t=1740594791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/cfcc5237c353de2d6f3faf07d2ba735f.mp4?t=1740594791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Platonic Forms might need some readjusting, because Mauri is the only walrus you need in your head.</p>",
    "short_description": "Mauri Mursu\u2019s Odyssey is not just a game \u2014 it\u2019s a legacy. A journey through time, space, and the elements themselves. Dive into a world where philosophy meets action, where every battle is a lesson, and where every victory brings you closer to mastering the mysteries of the universe.",
